            <div xml:id="m-779ad0f8-ec7b-441e-b811-428bf5905d19">
              <lg xml:id="m-6d584b6c-80cb-46fb-83a2-b7f3abe7880a">
                <l xml:id="m-65851d25-d0fa-492a-b211-4c0c4bf0eaa5" facs="#m-6ac46963-1283-4286-9da5-4661a58b4ba6" label="text-like">ist Sunday of the Passion.</l><l xml:id="m-d27f598d-4f96-4e5c-92c8-bd73ad172fc5" facs="#m-92b21324-98a0-46ac-9087-684317452fb0" label="ambiguous">572</l><l xml:id="m-ca86e7af-df5d-4dd8-9d5b-d7415cd5b22f" facs="#m-e84999f4-6f53-459e-847c-16ec7be4f4b7" label="ambiguous">runt me</l><l xml:id="m-cf9d0e73-99a1-4f9b-ac08-de96aaf9f967" facs="#m-f63ab621-106a-4064-b0aa-7cb7d5880c67" label="lyrics-like">a ju- ven-tú-te mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f13d26c4-98ff-453f-bab3-d436727b8721" facs="#m-c2f8dc3f-12db-4967-bdb8-8d44882f5e43" label="ambiguous">V. Ete¬</l><l xml:id="m-db78a91f-b899-4a02-968c-e15153df3485" facs="#m-0a2c844e-8603-4513-8da9-b973106a40c0" label="lyrics-like">nim non pot-u-é-runt</l><l xml:id="m-8f07de8c-0aa1-4c74-82fa-fafbd9a28cbb" facs="#m-c45caf5a-029d-4efd-b169-568a43a809e1" label="ambiguous">a.</l><l xml:id="m-c190e932-6c5e-4d6a-8cfe-9b17d1dbc54a" facs="#m-d9a8fd1e-7455-446d-ad73-f81bc8a4dc63" label="ambiguous">fabri¬</l><l xml:id="m-fdeae29e-bee2-4409-9e8f-aa26629985da" facs="#m-57099abc-181a-4bb9-931c-ec8075de3662" label="lyrics-like">supra dórsum mé¬ um</l><l xml:id="m-d92892b0-c20f-432d-9c43-17159703532d" facs="#m-7351f9d9-a565-484e-a31a-7a36cdbe1e0c" label="lyrics-like">mí-hi:</l><l xml:id="m-5eb3e2da-1e38-41b0-975f-d7ebfa7e743c" facs="#m-84697f01-615f-4d6f-ba65-7cb8d73fa910" label="lyrics-like">cavé¬ runt pecca-tó¬</l><l xml:id="m-dd7af9f2-5776-422b-9ef3-8fa93dd3a470" facs="#m-5fd7f45f-f98a-4cf3-80b2-9462da002d0d" label="ambiguous">res. V. Pro-longa¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fd27c88-5289-4741-aab8-8389ae1d3141" facs="#m-c904b74e-d8cf-4267-a315-8c6c9a67bb9b" label="lyrics-like">vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-880de22c-7b5b-4db1-99da-31a78a9a0bbf" facs="#m-ed6aa0b7-3b7e-4788-8fe9-fd1deb2c3f46" label="lyrics-like">runt in-i-qui-tá-tem sí-bi:</l><l xml:id="m-f7ae6f1e-04c3-4b64-b2cc-5485bbeaf561" facs="#m-54ab1da1-fb57-4818-b179-875fb20d72e9" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus jústus con¬c-det</l><l xml:id="m-1dc5cc9a-9027-4502-8ffe-5b4234feceac" facs="#m-4a50c068-ce06-4004-85e8-852f521b0757" label="lyrics-like">cerví¬ ces “ pecca¬</l><l xml:id="m-c076a91a-ad1c-42ef-aa94-3a42d6f4eaf1" facs="#m-d46b2980-67a4-4954-8e41-1a784dbb42f0" label="ambiguous">t6¬</l><l xml:id="m-785fc79b-99c6-45e5-b769-b4d4ab552eea" facs="#m-a72784c3-0d71-481f-b642-3e6088ece41f" label="ambiguous">rum.</l><l xml:id="m-3825e6de-4825-4752-b58c-0780edde61dd" facs="#m-cb4a59c0-1cb3-483d-a3df-c8c84391765f" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. 8,46-59.</l><l xml:id="m-489289d7-5450-4ca9-8f91-987148a0efdd" facs="#m-6091ccc5-cafc-4b6b-ab49-4ff9be8a47a8" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dicébat Jesus  meam: est qui quaerat, et júdicet.</l><l xml:id="m-b24158da-10d3-412b-8b0a-dc6c5998cf12" facs="#m-6e9a0eeb-0da1-4865-9e71-1f2d35b9e05c" label="lyrics-like">L turbis Judaeórum: Quis ex vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-8103e8f4-1a4f-4254-8f90-701314e97bc7" facs="#m-47ea7f8a-c9ec-4da6-a2c0-1365f3554c73" label="ambiguous">Amen, amen dico vobis: si quis</l><l xml:id="m-c5965d9f-8dbd-41a1-a762-ad9f74b9c907" facs="#m-5ac511e4-f9e7-46c3-ac74-a6eb233111a2" label="lyrics-like">bis árguet me de peccáto? Si veri¬</l><l xml:id="m-88b3c727-b5cb-4b1f-9c93-bc37bb7fa9ef" facs="#m-d16db54d-d22a-44be-be61-7ce7d09174d8" label="lyrics-like">sermónem meum serváverit, mor¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3acd2cc-951b-406d-8016-4ab45fcb0484" facs="#m-5f477c33-3740-47b1-b1cb-593471b5a2ae" label="lyrics-like">tátem dico vobis, quare non crédi¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f1e7e08-3e17-4473-ba45-559e79bdfe2e" facs="#m-96508a47-b387-4e09-a388-c131cc766569" label="lyrics-like">tem non vidébit in aetérnum. Dixé¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7d2d84f-fdbe-4581-8fa9-50ae120a600c" facs="#m-ceaec0ba-89cb-4a3f-a404-8e3fe34fc139" label="ambiguous">tis mihi? Qui ex Deo est, verba Dei</l><l xml:id="m-043ae492-53a7-4503-8132-19b81672496c" facs="#m-1d933458-4c13-49fd-aa83-2df424792c3f" label="lyrics-like">runt ergo Judaéi: Nunc cognóvi¬</l><l xml:id="m-12e6b2e6-6644-4a54-a43c-5af0b16fba38" facs="#m-ff598398-6b05-40cc-8984-45cc1dd5eb7d" label="lyrics-like">audit. Proptérea vos non audítis,</l><l xml:id="m-518a964e-1d06-489c-9601-e55cfc13b76a" facs="#m-b45a0adf-9d32-477f-bca8-6bf2288a43a6" label="lyrics-like">mus quia daemónium habes. Abra¬</l><l xml:id="m-c7e5653e-82c1-4e9e-9d9e-a9037137d31a" facs="#m-24b95394-055e-45bc-8800-ec199e925407" label="lyrics-like">quia ex Dẽo non estis. Respondé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e7d7bef-4cbd-4ec0-add7-b420aaa8fcbd" facs="#m-b54e052c-4c6b-4319-89e6-ce07cd9724ed" label="lyrics-like">ham mórtuus est, et prophétae: et</l><l xml:id="m-2239937c-09ad-4498-9a41-e7414e54d7e9" facs="#m-0bd724c9-a854-4e8d-b5ff-e3e9321e663f" label="lyrics-like">runt ergo Judaéi, et dixérunt ei:</l><l xml:id="m-9048062e-d28b-4971-bd81-da8fd4583c6d" facs="#m-3fe55ece-62b0-4e73-a0c7-a707214c6820" label="lyrics-like">tu dicis: Si quis sermónem meum</l><l xml:id="m-28139b0b-d0cb-4639-ad8d-45eaa7fe0956" facs="#m-fdfd6416-7115-470f-ac2d-e3c9a78d5c1e" label="lyrics-like">Nonne bene dícimus nos quia Sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-7653edf2-4966-4673-9e81-48bccf846225" facs="#m-0fe6089b-4926-430a-9d06-12678e7ec4d2" label="lyrics-like">serváverit, non gustábit mortem in</l><l xml:id="m-4cafe76e-2a9b-445c-8550-399ec724a687" facs="#m-333417a4-f9a9-4c32-844e-64144997ef87" label="lyrics-like">maritánus es tu, et daemónium ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ea97e96-c22e-4651-b14c-009abeb5bcfe" facs="#m-888db360-6063-438f-8bb9-af4af088c53d" label="lyrics-like">actérnum. Numquid tu major es</l><l xml:id="m-f2c59f56-1de0-42f4-98a3-772533129653" facs="#m-22a52016-a6b4-4f29-9cee-3b2dd7ca184d" label="lyrics-like">bes? Respóndit Jesus: Ego daemó¬</l><l xml:id="m-09e7127c-c8ad-4778-83ca-472aeee883dc" facs="#m-80ad753e-65f5-4738-ad9c-07285aba68c2" label="lyrics-like">patre nostro Abraham, qui mórtuus</l><l xml:id="m-de48dd4d-97b7-42cc-b344-ea7b32e386c2" facs="#m-77f26edc-fb5a-48e9-8243-2afdd62fe086" label="lyrics-like">nium non hábeo: sed honorífico</l><l xml:id="m-e582b4a3-1ad8-40ec-8caa-d24961e9d947" facs="#m-a8ba1c10-496a-4053-9825-03cfe88e50fc" label="lyrics-like">est? et prophétae mórtui sunt. Quem</l><l xml:id="m-36eb8088-57cc-4acb-92a8-3a54fc855da4" facs="#m-1a176d2e-fbac-4ded-b0be-056bddbe8d22" label="lyrics-like">Patrem meum, et vos inhonorástis</l><l xml:id="m-1d582c50-1bfe-4e9d-a17d-53f6c4e86e8a" facs="#m-6440cfb1-c089-4259-ba61-dd97dda7fd2e" label="lyrics-like">teípsum facis? Respóndit Jesus: Si</l><l xml:id="m-2e381d64-d76f-4cff-a514-25c2ea19ebb7" facs="#m-53a209e3-284c-4b0d-9459-dbe2bad21c53" label="lyrics-like">ego glorifico meipsum, glória mea</l><l xml:id="m-a4b42168-cf1c-446e-af31-32cea3adec46" facs="#m-99aaf090-8210-46d3-8e2a-fd2338e738fc" label="lyrics-like">me. Ego autem non quaero glóriam</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>